- PHASE-v1.6-FILE-SPLIT-AUDIT.md (industry validation, split plans)
- PHASE-v1.6-STATE-REFACTOR-GAMEPLAN.md (MVVM strategy, timeline)
- split-control-center.sh (automation script template)

INDUSTRY VALIDATION:
- Apple WWDC 2023: Extract state to ViewModels when views > 300 LOC
- Google/Facebook/Stripe: MVVM pattern for large views
- Standard: 400 LOC limit (Google Style Guide)

Phase v1.7 (State Extraction) is HIGH PRIORITY prerequisite for Phase v1.6.

